sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Program.Main
    participant A as App
    participant S as Services
    participant MW as MainWindow
    participant VM as MainViewModel
    participant T as TabItem

    P->>P: 注册异常处理器
    P->>A: BuildAvaloniaApp()
    A->>A: RegisterServices()
    Note over A: 初始化 WebView 服务
    A->>A: Initialize()
    Note over A: 加载 XAML 资源
    A->>A: OnFrameworkInitializationCompleted()
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over A: 创建服务层
        A->>S: new MermaidService()
        A->>S: new SettingsService()
        A->>S: new FileService()
    end
    
    A->>MW: new MainWindow()
    A->>VM: new MainViewModel(...)
    
    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over VM: MainViewModel 构造函数
        VM->>VM: 加载用户设置
        VM->>VM: 加载最近文件列表
        VM->>T: AddNewTab()
        Note over T: 创建默认标签页<br/>Content = string.Empty
        T->>VM: 触发 ContentChanged
        VM->>VM: ScheduleValidationAndRender()
        Note over VM: 因 Content 为空<br/>不触发 WebView 创建
    end
    
    A->>MW: DataContext = viewModel
    MW->>MW: OnDataContextChanged
    MW->>MW: RefreshEditorState()
    MW->>MW: UpdateWorkspaceLayout()
    MW->>MW: UpdateWebPreview()
    Note over MW: 因 Content 为空<br/>跳过 WebView 初始化
    
    alt 命令行参数包含文件路径
        A->>VM: OpenFileFromPath(args[1])
        VM->>VM: 读取并渲染文件内容
    end
    
    A->>MW: desktop.MainWindow = mainWindow
    Note over MW: 窗口显示完成
